## 4. derivedStateOf 和 remember 规范

### 强制要求
- 派生计算（基于其他状态）必须用 `derivedStateOf`，**禁止**直接在 Composable 中计算
- `remember` 的 key 参数必须包含所有影响结果的状态，**禁止**省略 key
- 耗时计算用 `rememberSaveable` 或 `derivedStateOf` 缓存

### 正确写法
```kotlin
// ✅ derivedStateOf 派生状态
@Composable
fun TodoList(tasks: List<Task>) {
    val filter by remember { mutableStateOf(TaskFilter.ALL) }

    val filteredTasks by remember(filter, tasks) {
        derivedStateOf {
            when (filter) {
                TaskFilter.ALL -> tasks
                TaskFilter.DONE -> tasks.filter { it.isDone }
                TaskFilter.PENDING -> tasks.filter { !it.isDone }
            }
        }
    }
}

// ✅ remember with keys
@Composable
fun UserAvatar(user: User) {
    val avatarUrl by remember(user.id, user.avatarVersion) {
        mutableStateOf(user.getAvatarUrl())
    }
    // ✅ 包含所有影响 avatarUrl 的 key
}
```

