## 5. 内存泄漏防护

### 强制要求
- **禁止**在 `LaunchedEffect`、`rememberCoroutineScope` 中捕获 `Activity-scoped` 的 `Context`
- **禁止**在 `companion object` 或 `static` 区域持有 View / Context 引用
- `DisposableEffect` 中注册的资源（BroadcastReceiver、LocationListener、Flow 收集）必须在 `DisposableEffect` 的 `onDispose` 中取消
- ViewModel 中使用 `viewModelScope`，**禁止** `GlobalScope`

### 正确写法
```kotlin
// ✅ DisposableEffect 正确取消
@Composable
fun LocationScreen() {
    val context =LocalContext.current // Activity Context ❌ 不能在 LaunchedEffect 中直接用

    DisposableEffect(Unit) {
        val listener = object : LocationListener {
            override fun onLocationChanged(loc: Location) { /* ... */ }
        }
        val manager = context.getSystemService<LocationManager>()
        manager.requestLocationUpdates(listener)

        onDispose {
            manager.removeUpdates(listener)  // ✅ 取消注册
        }
    }
}

// ✅ rememberCoroutineScope 用于局部协程
@Composable
fun PartialCoroutine() {
    val scope = rememberCoroutineScope()

    Button(onClick = {
        scope.launch { /* 局部协程 */ }
    }) { Text("点击") }
}
```

### 禁止写法
```kotlin
// ❌ LaunchedEffect 中捕获 Activity Context
LaunchedEffect(Unit) {
    val activity = context as Activity  // ❌ 捕获了 Activity
    // ...
}

// ❌ 静态区域持有 View 引用
class BadAdapter {
    companion object {
        var sharedView: View? = null  // ❌ 静态持有 View
    }
}

// ❌ DisposableEffect 未取消注册
DisposableEffect(Unit) {
    val receiver = BroadcastReceiver { /* ... */ }
    context.registerReceiver(receiver)
    // ❌ 缺少 onDispose { context.unregisterReceiver(receiver) }
}
```

